# ==============================================================================
# AI Quant Trading Bot - Email & Notification Dispatch Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Choose ANY of the following methods to receive your OTP codes:

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 1: BREVO / SENDINBLUE API (RECOMMENDED - Easiest & Free)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.brevo.com (free 300 emails/day).
# 2. Go to "SMTP & API" -> "API Keys" -> "Generate a new API key".
# 3. Paste your key below (No Google App Passwords or SMTP ports needed!):
#
# BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-your_brevo_api_key_here
# BREVO_FROM=your_email@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 2: RESEND API (Super fast HTTP API)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com (free 100 emails/day).
# 2. Create an API Key and paste it below:
#
#RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 3: TELEGRAM BOT NOTIFICATIONS (Instant OTP on your Phone)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Open Telegram and search for @BotFather -> send /newbot to create a bot.
# 2. Copy the bot token.
# 3. Message your bot, then get your chat ID from @userinfobot.
#
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrSTUvwxYZ
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_telegram_numeric_id

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 4: SENDGRID API
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.your_sendgrid_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 5: GMAIL SMTP (Requires Google App Password)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
# SMTP_FROM=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_USE_SSL=0

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METHOD 6: OUTLOOK / OFFICE 365 SMTP
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.office365.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_email@outlook.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your_outlook_password
# SMTP_FROM=your_email@outlook.com
# SMTP_USE_SSL=0
